{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"1630","name":"翠绿之影","desc":"翠绿之影","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/02/08/76373921/ae68bc60a8cbe70c4eeaa1e93c83539a_8639909691947928213.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基础信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\" 稀有度 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e4星/5星\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\" 获取途径 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"374\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/03/30/4328207/5983cac48948a953027c9cf1b5583ae4_4503346464479263794.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"铭记之谷\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/374/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/374/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e铭记之谷\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e：钢铁之舞 Ⅱ ～Ⅴ 概率掉落（4星）；钢铁之舞 Ⅳ ～Ⅴ 概率掉落（5星）；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e合成台「还圣奥迹」获取；\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"502145\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/08/28/50494840/d29726b96c9ee790cae261ddbc5f9989_3936286629804858604.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"圣言自明机\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502145/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502145/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e圣言自明机\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e定义获取。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"2件套效果 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e获得15%风元素伤害加成。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"4件套效果 \",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e扩散反应造成的伤害提升60%，星扩散反应造成的伤害提升20%。根据扩散的元素类型，降低受到影响的敌人40%的对应元素抗性，持续10秒。对敌人触发星扩散反应时，也会降低其40%的冰元素抗性。同元素类型的抗性降低效果无法叠加。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"4","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"生之花","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"生之花：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"生之花：\",\"value\":[\"野花记忆的绿野\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/12/4521515/ae68bc60a8cbe70c4eeaa1e93c83539a_768467329310108095.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e曾经遍布某地的野花，离开了大地，被猎人佩在胸前。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e曾经遍布大地，茂密生长的洁白野花。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e始终没有枯干，仍散发着清新的香气。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在猎物横行大地的过去，彼时灾厄的魔物还没有诞生，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e猎人用现今已不知名的这种野花掩盖自己的人的气息。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e古时的人们传说，若是要寻找无言而温和的孤独猎人，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e就循着淡淡的野花香气，闭着眼赤脚在林间与原野走，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e只有像猎人那般行走，才不会踏碎落叶，令猎人警觉。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e另有传说：最终找到猎人的是个少年。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e彼时古国的灾厄刚刚发生。生灵涂炭。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"5","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"死之羽","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"死之羽：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"死之羽：\",\"value\":[\"猎人青翠的箭羽\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/12/4521515/63a9957a742f79553bc8c3fb73db55f0_463378955391885105.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e曾经一瞬贯穿猎物的箭矢的尾羽，如今依旧平整光洁。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e油亮光洁的猛禽翎羽，曾是箭簇尾羽的良才。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在过去，猎人会无数次地安抚被箭矢穿透的猎物，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e直到它的生命平静的归于大地，因为她心里明白，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e她的猎物前往的那处地方，她终有一天也会到达。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e她相信温和的猎人在生命的末尾会从现实中醒来，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在无边无际的猎场中与如今已经不再的人们团聚。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e但她也相信：在她放箭贯穿了追杀少年的魔物后，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在她聆听了他的请求，为了替人（和谐）复仇、为了痛苦，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e而不是为了生存、为了自然，猎杀畸变的魔物后。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e自己已经失去了那生命尽头的无边无际的猎场了。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"6","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"时之沙","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"时之沙：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"时之沙：\",\"value\":[\"翠绿猎人的笃定\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/12/4521515/f2951bce9f694fbfd032d9feefe5cf1a_5172445959179757259.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e猎人曾经随身携带的奇妙仪器，永远指向自己的猎物。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e构造奇特的小装置，能让人辨明方向与方位。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e传说，当猎人赤着脚在原野中静静地行走时，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e趾间的青草会告诉她，湿润的泥土会告诉她，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e大树上的雀鸟看见的，泥土里的树根听见的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e传说，自从古国灾厄降临，草木就不再开口。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e因为司掌草木的神也在灾厄中，一同死去了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在那之后，她仰仗着这件仪器在大地上游猎。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e受少年所托，从此狩猎的不再是走兽与飞禽，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e而是自古国流出的，带来灾祸与痛苦的魔物。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"7","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"空之杯","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"空之杯：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"空之杯：\",\"value\":[\"翠绿猎人的容器\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/12/4521515/8d8a6446c7297f298a2bc0eb09b90172_1998753755214901423.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e绿野猎人曾用过的水壶，里面的空间远比想象的更大。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e非常结实耐用的容器，有着极佳的密封性。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e传说中的猎人曾将篝火边的细语装了进去。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e猎人曾经偶然在深夜的原野中嗅到他人的气味。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e面对群狼与魔物也毫不畏惧的她，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e最终仍没有加入火边对谈的胆量。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e那时的猎人已经忘记了人的语言应该如何发音。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e即便日后，她受人所托，成了翠绿的魔物猎手，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e也从没有人听过她说话，正如她从不留下足迹。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e…\u003c/span\u003e那夜，她将听见的谈笑声装进自己的水囊中，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e许多年里，每每感到孤寂，便倾听其中的声音。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"8","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"理之冠","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"artifact_list_v2","layout":"","data":"{\"title\":\"理之冠：\",\"name\":{\"key\":\"理之冠：\",\"value\":[\"翠绿的猎人之冠\"]},\"icon_url\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/10/12/4521515/1dfbc40e490be80d78612f0ae122e5a8_8989235229082922683.png\",\"desc\":{\"key\":\"描述：\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e曾属于绿野猎人的骄傲头冠，如同原野之风一般青翠。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"story\":{\"key\":\"故事\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e从未沾染过一丝鲜血的猎人帽，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e属于民话中的无冕的猎人之王。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e猎者的法理是不与大地，森林为敌，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e而是成为自然当中无言的一枝一叶。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e据说曾经有鸟儿在这顶帽子里筑巢。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e无人能为最为杰出的猎人冠冕，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e因为高于她的只有自然的天地。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e后来这顶猎人帽的绿意成了灾厄中，\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在魔物中，令他们无比胆寒的光景。\u003c/p\u003e\"]}}\n","style":""}],"id":"9","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"搭配推荐","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色推荐\",\"header\":[\"角色名称\",\"推荐原因\",\"词缀搭配\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"57\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/3008da32b80ba05f243bc2c858b534b5_540461000064419548.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"温迪\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/57/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/57/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/3008da32b80ba05f243bc2c858b534b5_540461000064419548.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e温迪\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e翠绿之影四件套的减抗效果配合温迪的元素战技或元素爆发，可将场上大范围的敌人聚到一起的同时，再降低怪物的元素抗性。能有效增强输出与辅助能力。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比/元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e风元素伤害加成/元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害/元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e元素充能效率＞暴击率/暴击伤害＞攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1498\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/a02533e3ac055344982bcfd04865ae72_6103227973780149519.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"魈\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1498/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1498/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/a02533e3ac055344982bcfd04865ae72_6103227973780149519.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e魈\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e魈是攻击力倍率的风系主C，翠绿之影两件套能够提供风元素伤害加成，加上提供攻击力加成两件套效果例如\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/1633/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e角斗士的终幕礼\u003c/a\u003e，是魈比较通用的搭配。魈的毕业圣遗物是4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/3867/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e辰砂\u003c/a\u003e或4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/500037/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e猎人\u003c/a\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e风元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害＞攻击力百分比＞元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"505504\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/06/19/50494840/f394baeb5099e1ac12db23e16445c82e_6757723224935154347.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"旅行者·风\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/505504/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/505504/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/06/19/50494840/f394baeb5099e1ac12db23e16445c82e_6757723224935154347.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e旅行者·风\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"505499\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/06/19/50494840/85a0e35d3f9dcd86004e69ac5c27d94a_8212727181575963340.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"旅行者·风\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/505499/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/505499/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/06/19/50494840/85a0e35d3f9dcd86004e69ac5c27d94a_8212727181575963340.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e旅行者·风\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e翠绿之影四件套的减抗效果配合旅行者的元素战技或元素爆发，可将场上的敌人聚到一起的同时降低怪物的元素抗性。能有效增强输出与辅助能力。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比/元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e风元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害＞元素充能效率＞元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"59\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/02/16/6276411/a7608c6a588467440f7685a22ab6547c_3946325001679449884.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"琴\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/59/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/59/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/02/16/6276411/a7608c6a588467440f7685a22ab6547c_3946325001679449884.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e琴\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e翠绿之影四件套的减抗效果配合琴的元素战技或元素爆发，为其他角色回复生命值的同时降低怪物的元素抗性。能有效增强辅助能力。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e风元素伤害加成/攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害/治疗加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e元素充能效率＞攻击力百分比＞暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2142\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/2566b97ea262980d9bcd7db6a116bfd4_6795571745044574054.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"枫原万叶\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2142/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2142/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/2566b97ea262980d9bcd7db6a116bfd4_6795571745044574054.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e枫原万叶\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e翠绿之影四件套减抗效果配合万叶元素战技和元素爆发，可降低怪物元素抗性并提供元素伤害加成。万叶天赋可根据精通为队友提供元素伤害加成，因此主词条选择精精精。满命万叶也可精风暴打输出。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e元素精通/风元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e元素精通/暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e元素精通＞元素充能效率＞暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500673\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/01/25/4328207/ead14be79052a8d19bbbb2a69c2f0c23_2532694057563153983.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"闲云\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500673/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500673/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/01/25/4328207/ead14be79052a8d19bbbb2a69c2f0c23_2532694057563153983.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e闲云\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e翠绿之影四件套减抗效果配合闲云元素战技和元素爆发，可降低怪物元素抗性。通常在主打元素反应的队伍里4翠绿表现会优于4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/1631/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e宗室\u003c/a\u003e和4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/500421/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e昔时\u003c/a\u003e。主词条在满足充能和治疗量前提下尽可能多堆攻击力。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比/元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比/治疗加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e元素充能效率＞攻击力百分比＞暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"5494\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/05/195563531/fb1713aa667884c5552452170b5931fa_4501254112268017431.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"流浪者\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5494/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/5494/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/06/05/195563531/fb1713aa667884c5552452170b5931fa_4501254112268017431.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e流浪者\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e流浪者是攻击力倍率的风系主C，翠绿之影两件套能够提供风元素伤害加成，加上提供攻击力加成两件套效果例如\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/1633/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e角斗士的终幕礼\u003c/a\u003e，是流浪者比较通用的搭配。流浪者的毕业圣遗物是4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/5403/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e楼阁\u003c/a\u003e。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e风元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害＞攻击力百分比＞元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1055\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/b30efaf1e19725ddda490a2028b17464_6998283335917930867.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"砂糖\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1055/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1055/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/b30efaf1e19725ddda490a2028b17464_6998283335917930867.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e砂糖\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e翠绿之影四件套的减抗效果配合砂糖的元素战技或元素爆发，可降低敌人的元素抗性并为其他角色提供元素精通加成。通常携带精精精提高天赋对队友的元素精通加成。缺乏充能时可带充能沙。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e元素精通/元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e元素精通＞元素充能效率＞暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"503614\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/25/4328207/3f06ace813ea5d401cce5088257212ee_1796029922647873700.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"蓝砚\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/503614/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/503614/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/12/25/4328207/3f06ace813ea5d401cce5088257212ee_1796029922647873700.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e蓝砚\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e蓝砚元素战技命中目标时接触对应元素会发生元素转化，且对敌人造成元素伤害，翠绿之影四件套可以降低蓝砚所扩散元素的对应抗性，提升对应元素队友的输出能力，且二件套的风伤加成可提高蓝砚的输出能力。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力/元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e攻击力＞元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"507287\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/11/28/50494840/2d8bafcf920d23e6b0307bfbb8287547_1851629366329380334.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"雅珂达\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/507287/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/507287/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/11/28/50494840/2d8bafcf920d23e6b0307bfbb8287547_1851629366329380334.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e雅珂达\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e作为风元素角色，雅珂达可以通过元素战技或者元素爆发触发对应元素的扩散反应，搭配翠绿之影四件套的减抗效果，可以有效地降低对应元素的抗性，提升队伍的输出能力。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力/治疗\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e攻击力/元素充能效率/暴击率·（西风猎弓）\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"508597\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/05/14/50494840/74aed1aa8dbcf9161899ec11f9ff7158_4356580513562050351.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"布伦妮\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/508597/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/508597/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/05/14/50494840/74aed1aa8dbcf9161899ec11f9ff7158_4356580513562050351.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e布伦妮\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e布伦妮辅助火/水/雷/冰系主C时，优先推荐使用翠绿之影四件套，通过元素战技或是元素爆发触发对应元素的扩散反应来降低对应元素的抗性，提升队伍的输出能力，注意布伦妮的攻击力要在兼顾元素充能的情况下尽量堆到4000点来叠满天赋2。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力/元素充能效率\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e攻击力/元素充能效率/暴击率（西风秘典）\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"2125\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/10/75276545/4f50355892c08017346ea3ab80071b9c_1725343112540399387.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"早柚\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2125/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/2125/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/10/75276545/4f50355892c08017346ea3ab80071b9c_1725343112540399387.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e早柚\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e早柚作为攻击倍率的风系治疗角色，翠绿之影四件套配合早柚cd短频率高的元素战技和爆发，不仅能给予一定伤害加成还能提供减抗效果，十分契合。可以精精精主打扩散伤害，也可以攻攻治增加治疗量。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e元素充能效率/元素精通/攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e元素精通/攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e元素精通/治疗加成/攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e元素精通＞攻击力百分比＞元素充能效率＞暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"6938\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/08/17/24077343/74feea88c304c86a33be3fd191d055dc_2469184593388252358.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"琳妮特\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6938/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/6938/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/08/17/24077343/74feea88c304c86a33be3fd191d055dc_2469184593388252358.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e琳妮特\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e翠绿之影四件套的减抗效果配合琳妮特的元素战技或元素爆发，可降低敌人的元素抗性。元素爆发还可以提高队友的攻击力。满命琳妮特也可以携带2风+2攻或4\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/500037/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e猎人\u003c/a\u003e打输出。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e元素充能效率/攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e风元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e元素充能效率＞暴击率/暴击伤害＞攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\"],[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"4197\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/07/09/4328207/cc145e6cd2f0dacb39ce36f7ebf257fc_7138351098291917226.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"鹿野院平藏\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/4197/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/4197/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/07/09/4328207/cc145e6cd2f0dacb39ce36f7ebf257fc_7138351098291917226.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e鹿野院平藏\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e平藏是攻击力倍率的风系输出，翠绿之影两件套能够提供风元素伤害加成，加上提供攻击力加成两件套效果例如\u003ca href=\\\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/ys/obc/content/1633/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e角斗士的终幕礼\u003c/a\u003e，是平藏比较通用的搭配。也可以携带4件套帮助队友降低敌人的元素抗性。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e时之沙：\u003c/strong\u003e攻击力百分比\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e空之杯：\u003c/strong\u003e风元素伤害加成\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e理之冠：\u003c/strong\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e暴击率/暴击伤害＞攻击力百分比＞元素充能效率/元素精通\u003c/p\u003e\"]]},{\"tab_name\":\"圣遗物成长数据\",\"header\":[\"\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1279\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/11/29/76373921/d8aa4bdb17f0e16298b05c10bc149846_1243318391411958522.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"圣遗物成长数据\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1279/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1279/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/11/29/76373921/d8aa4bdb17f0e16298b05c10bc149846_1243318391411958522.png\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e圣遗物成长数据\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"10","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1791478660","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"2","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"2","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"4","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"3","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"5","pos":"banner"},{"id":"6","pos":"banner"},{"id":"7","pos":"banner"},{"id":"8","pos":"banner"},{"id":"9","pos":"bann